<title>USA: Utah Medical to buy back 1 mln shrs in 97.</title>
<headline>Utah Medical to buy back 1 mln shrs in 97.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utah Medical Products Inc said Friday that it will repurchase one million shares of its stock in 1997 in the open market if its share price remains near current levels.</p>
<p>The company said that so far in 1996, it has repurchased 993,800 of its shares.</p>
<p>Current outstanding shares are now 8,845,053.</p>
<p>Utah Medical stock closed at 11-11/16 Friday, up 4/16.</p>
